<html>
    <head>
        <title>Reploid Museum</title>
        <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="/css/style.css">
        <dashboard>
            <button onclick="window.location.href='/'"> 
                Home Page
            </button>
            <button onclick="window.location.href='/specialExhibits'"> 
                Special Exhibits 
            </button>
            <button onclick="window.location.href='/submitExhibit'"> 
                Submit Exhibit
            </button>
        </dashboard>
    </head>
    <body>
        <header>
            <h1>Reploid Museum</h1>
        </header>
        <main>
            <p>Before reploids were ever conceived, there was a man named Dr. Cain. He was a brilliant scientist,  
                who on one fated day during a site excavation encountered the remains of Dr Thomas Light's laboratory.
            inside said laboratory, he discovered 'X' an advanced robot with self consciousness, able to make his own
            choices. X would serve as the base for what we now know as reploids.</p>
        </main>
        <% archives.forEach(card => { %>
            <li>
                <h2><%= card.name %></h2>
                <p><%= card.description %></p>
                <img src="<%= card.imageUrl %>" alt="<%= card.name %>" width="300" height="400">
            </li>
        <% }); %>
    </body>
</html>